  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarships Programme Operational Management Phase 1: Transition to Education New Zealand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity,&#xA0;following on from the Scholarships Improvement Project, aims to transition operational management of the Manaaki New Zealand Scholarships Programme to Education New Zealand. Education New Zealand will take over&#xA0;administration of the programme in its current state, with MFAT operational staff and contractors transferring and working from Education New Zealand premises.</narrative>
  </description>
